    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Concept.</strong> A Scion conveyance strung with prayer-thread and lit from inside by a Spark someone is definitely supposed to be guarding more carefully. It carries the faithful toward the Great Work and the curious toward awkward theological conversations.</p>\n<p><strong>Signature.</strong> Its passage steadies allied resolve and sways the undecided. The Spark in the lantern hums in a key that makes the air feel load-bearing.</p>",
